{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ooga like meat. Pterosaur also like meat. Pterosaur steal Ooga's meat! <strong>Ooga MAD!!!</strong> Must get meat back! Spear help Ooga get meat! Spear defy all known laws of physics! Use to advantage! Soar like Pterosaur with spear! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2699570/extras/cc0064a2b9f87b422aad3c98e1f470b9.avif?t=1771112768\" width=600 height=194 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Climb and fly through levels using Spears and Slopes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master the intuitive and tight momentum system </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 80 levels with unique area mechanics and enemies in each world</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dozens of unlockable optional levels with unique visuals, designed to challenge the most skilled Oogas.  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A cute and loveable protagonist filled with combustible gasses </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play the first world and a half in the free demo, secrets included!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2699570?t=1771112768","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2699570?t=1771112768","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2699570/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1771112768","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2699570/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1771112768","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Includes level editor","id":17},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[